p the spriteFirst, we slice the artwork into separate pieces: head, torso, arms, legs, and so on. This lets us move each part independently without distorting the whole image.Step 2: Rigging and weight painting Next, we build a 2D skeleton and bind it to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T11:04:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929248","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:42:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5089240-1842846814445807","game_id":"steam-5089240","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update: New Scenery Preview","summary":"Hello everyone!It’s been a little while since we released our demo, and we’d love to know how your experience has been so far.Thank you so much for all the feedback and support. Our team has been reading through every single comment, and we’re using your input to make the full game even better. We really can’t wait for you to experience the complete story!If you haven’t already, please consider adding the game to your Steam Wishlist. It really helps us out a lot:Today, we wanted to share a sneak","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T09:03:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445807","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:42:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5089240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:38:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:38:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5089240":"2026-10-25T22:38:21Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5089240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:38:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:38:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5129570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:38:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:38:21Z","status"